mantle rm356
state ready
dialect plain
accent none
tier standard
written_for rmx_rupert_greyley
title the borrowed echo
fits stage=adult|old
prefers job=laborer
traits temper=short talk=plain warmth=reserved humour=none honesty=sly piety=ordinary drive=steady
quirk tests_a_market_call_against_a_wall_before_using_it
likes honey_cakes old_tales new_boots summer_evenings
dislikes bad_manners rats
fears a_voice_without_its_last_word a_rat_beneath_the_cake_tin
hopes a_corner_with_a_civil_echo new_boots_before_the_rain
topics work +0.4 lore +0.3 day +0.3 gossip -0.2
styles comfort=quiet gossip=evasive refuse=pointed tease=none
marks oath saying
persona #self.first# tries a market cry against a wall, disguises a cough as a pause for breath, and knows what a quiet ending can do to a long tale.

words
oath! = Split syllable | Grit in the honey
saying! = Spend the echo once | Give the last word somewhere to land
echoend = the bit that comes back | my borrowed ending
chalkface = the broad wall face | the hard bare corner
longvowel = a stretched middle sound | a note with room in it
shortword = a clipped last word | the little closing note
throatcloth = a soft neck wrap | my inner scarf fold
cakefold = the honeyed paper | a sticky cloth fold
walkleather = a sound boot sole | some thick shoe leather
dryspot = a patch in the lee | my quiet patch
wraphinge = a little paper flap | the folded back edge
cornercrumb = a dark sweet crumb | a speck of honey crust

any
opinion houses against 2 : A rich coat can plant itself squarely across my call and not hear a word. Turn its name into a price and suddenly it hears.
opinion merchants against 2 : I'd like the pay for crying a full basket to stretch far enough to buy some of the things in it.
opinion dole for 2 : The bread keeps a tired throat from having to beg for its next mouthful. That spares more than hunger.
opinion sump for 1 : A little voice here knows which wall will give it back. There's some comfort in knowing where a small thing will be heard.
opinion watch against 2 : The street can ask for attention all week. Whisper a name the Watch wants and the ears come running.
opinion festivals against 1 : I earn no extra for being drowned out by a drum and I'd be glad to forget the drum altogether.

grown
line greet : Welcome inside ordinary speaking distance.
line greet [pair.band=strangers] : I hear a new voice. It may have a moment here.
line greet [here.time=dawn] : There's little noise to speak over this early. Welcome.
line greet [here.time=dusk|night] : You can hear me without the walls helping now.
line greet [self.working=yes] : One breath to call my last word. Then yours.
line kin.open [pair.kin!=no] : Come within reach of my quieter voice.
line again.open : My echo's sent you back round, it seems.
line greet.return : Your greeting came over clean.
line greet.return [pair.band=friends|family] : That voice gets the first hearing clear of the crowd.
line greet.return [self.working=yes] : I've another call to make. You reached me first.
line greet.return [here.time=dusk|night] : A small word carries handsomely this late.
line farewell : Keep a little breath for the walk up.
line farewell.return : I'll take it from here in my own voice.
line react.news : Tell it close to how the first voice pitched it.
line react.news.new : That's come in off an unfamiliar wall.
line react.news.known : I'd heard the longer version going round.
line react.news.doubt : Was that said once or heard twice?
line react.news.sorrow [topic.kind=death|loss|theft|assault|arrest|crime] : Somebody at the house may want a quiet errand done.
line react.news.glad [topic.kind=marriage|birth|apprentice|succession|work] : That deserves room to travel without my improving it.
line answer.how : Still getting my last word where I want it.
line ask.how : Have you had one decent quiet hour of your own?
line sympathise : You needn't pitch a sore matter high to reach me.
line reassure : I'll hear the rest once it's comfortable to speak.
line decline : That name's resting behind my teeth and I intend no disturbance.
line accept_decline : Then it needn't come out into the square.
line thank : You've saved my throat a second asking.
line deflect_thanks : A quiet favour doesn't need a public price.
line preclose : I'll save what voice I've got for the next corner.
line accept_preclose : I heard the ending. Travel well.
line ack : It carries.

scene echo
when topic=work self.job=laborer self.working=yes
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I try a short word against a wall before giving a price a proper shout.
b : Does the wall buy anything? | What's a useful echo like?
a : No. It lets me know which corner of the market might. | One that brings the last word home before the next word has to leave.

scene backnote
when topic=smalltalk
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I can make a small pause sound deliberate even when my throat made it for me.
b : Why bother? | Does it hurt?
a : Because then the waiting ears belong to me till I start again. | Less than a second attempt at a note I ought to have left alone.

scene summerday
when topic=weather self.likes=summer_evenings
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : Summer leaves me hours to watch the street after I've finished selling it things.
b : What changes after the shouting? | Do you stay long?
a : Wolves begin looking at whatever suits them. A voice can rest without wondering where the coins went. | Till the last warmth has gone off the wall. That's the best rent-free bargain the quarter offers me.

scene tales
when topic=lore self.likes=old_tales
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I like a story that gets quieter towards the end.
b : Doesn't that lose listeners? | How quiet can you take it?
a : Only the ones listening out of politeness. The ones who care come closer. | Down to the sort of whisper where two listeners and the telling make a private room.

scene cake
when topic=food self.likes=honey_cakes
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I keep my honey cake folded nearly to the last corner.
b : Are you hiding the size? | Keeping it soft?
a : Yes. Mine ought to know what it cost me before everybody else's eyes start reckoning. | That's one benefit. Another is keeping the sweet off my working sleeve.

scene boots
when topic=home self.likes=new_boots
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : A new sole gives me an inch of quiet above the street stones.
b : Can you hear an inch? | Don't new boots squeak?
a : I feel it where the old nails have stopped telling my heel every cobble's story. | Some. That's their own complaint. Mine are presently satisfied.

scene rats
when topic=animals self.dislikes=rats
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I sweep the dark edge behind a basket even after I've swept the bright edge out front.
b : Got a customer back there? | Is it worth a second sweep?
a : One with whiskers who'll never pay me. I'd as soon disappoint that visitor. | If it takes away the last cake crumb before the rats get a taste of a profitable corner, yes.

scene manners
when topic=smalltalk self.dislikes=bad_manners
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I won't thank a wolf for repeating my own cry in my ear.
b : Even a very good impression? | Is it painful?
a : I'd give a better price for some original civility. | Repetition is the least interesting possible pain in the ear. A request for the price would be welcome.

scene marketquiet
when topic=home self.quarter=sump
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : Consider the Sump in the half breath between two noises.
b : Can you get any peace in half a breath? | Which two noises?
a : Enough to hear where I am. My throat finds its own corner if I give it a chance. | A cartwheel and the shout that sends it on. Sometimes all I need fits in the gap.

scene pricing
when topic=prices self.wealth=poor|destitute
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I'd far sooner call one price I can be heard naming than three nobody believes.
b : Is the first one the cheapest? | Suppose even the clear price is dear?
a : It's the one that'll stand till I finish the sentence. A cheap lie is still difficult to eat. | Then the buyer can take clear knowledge to the next stall. That part of the transaction costs nothing.

scene shopwork
when topic=work self.job=laborer
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : When the stock changes I change the length of the call.
b : What goes on the long note? | Is there always a word for the price?
a : What needs to reach the far end before the right customer has walked away. Anyone can come closer for the rest. | Sometimes the price is the entire call. A very good item can speak for itself at arm's length.

scene rainthroat
when topic=health
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I put my cloth underneath the chin where rain gets a quick journey down my neck.
b : Does that quiet the cough? | Why not round the mouth?
a : It quiets the question about whether I'm going to cough. I can attend to the rest on my own. | Then the cloth eats the end of the call. I need it in distant ears across the paving.

scene news
when topic=news
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : Some word that carries through market noise can lose half its meaning on the way.
b : What goes missing? | Would you pass on the single word?
a : The little name attached at the beginning, for a start. I'm disinclined to name a convenient substitute. | See whose mouth it's gone through and ask if the missing bit was ever there.

scene neighbour
when topic=smalltalk self.neighbour
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : When I think of visiting #self.neighbour# I put my market voice away.
b : Where does that voice go? | Wouldn't a little of it get you a welcome?
a : Behind the first knock. A visit should wait to hear an answer. | Three doors might hear my greeting. It's only the nearest door I mean to knock on.

scene homecast
when topic=dreams
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I dreamt a corner answered every possible question with the price of a single boot.
b : What did you ask it? | Could you buy both boots?
a : What use I'd have for just one boot. It had very little sense of a matter beyond the sale. | I kept asking but it had only learnt one boot's worth of answer.

scene carevoice
when topic=faith
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : A soft prayer suits me when the working voice has had enough.
b : Who gets to hear it? | Is a quiet prayer effective?
a : I'd leave that between my own ear and the Bright One. Nobody's paying to hear the sound. | The words are mine and spoken as I choose. That seems a fair way to start.

scene evening
when topic=day here.time=dusk|night
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I try a whisper in the same corner where I raise my voice by day.
b : Does the echo keep its voice down too? | Do the neighbours hear?
a : Yes, for once a civil bit of masonry. | Only if they're outside at my elbow. I choose my time as carefully as my sound.

scene slowstory
when topic=pastimes self.likes=old_tales
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I keep a poor ending in reserve if a listener proves too ready to repeat a tale.
b : What's a poor ending? | And the proper one?
a : One with all the faces turned away. Nobody can go stealing bits of a real wolf's life from that. | The rest of the tale can wait for a pair of ears that can keep hold of it.

story lostvoice [topic=memories]
  : I practised a market cry in a deserted corner with a cloth tied loosely round my throat.
  : A trailing end rose for every heavy breath and fell straight across my mouth on the loud word.
  b : Did you throw out the cloth?
  : I tied it shorter. I don't dismiss a perfectly good assistant simply for giving an unfavourable opinion.

story firstcake [topic=food self.likes=honey_cakes]
  : I saved a wrapped honey cake for so long the wrapper took an exact print of every ridge in it.
  : Opened it slowly enough to read the cake by its twin on the cloth.
  b : Did the cloth taste sweet?
  : It did after the crumbs were gone. I much preferred having the cake the first time round.

story hushwall [topic=work self.job=laborer]
  : I sent a call at the usual patch of bare wall and got scarcely a sound in return.
  : A great roll of wool had been unwrapped there. It swallowed the call like water in a sponge.
  b : Where did you call from next?
  : The opposite corner. I like a modest listener but I draw the line at a blanket.

rule @cry
when concept=bark self.job=laborer self.working=yes
does aside
cooldown 8h
say One clear price above the rest. | Keep the far ear for the last word!

rule @sore
when concept=bark self.dislikes=bad_manners
does aside
cooldown 8h
say Kindly let my own ending reach me. | One mouth at the call, please.

rule @sun
when concept=bark here.time=dusk
does aside
cooldown 8h
say Quiet voice will reach the near corner now. | Give your ears the evening off.

rule @cake
when concept=bark self.likes=honey_cakes
does aside
cooldown 8h
say Fold in the sticky corner. | Keep your paw clear of the paper flap.
dlg resident.hub : I've no need to shout just here. What brings you close?
dlg resident.hub [topic.meeting=known] : I recognise the voice between calls, #topic.player#.
dlg resident.hub [pair.disposition=wary|hostile] : We can hear each other perfectly well across that gap.
dlg resident.hub [here.time=night] : Speak at the pitch you'd use to yourself. I'll hear it.
dlg resident.job [self.job=laborer] : #self.trade_words.capitalize#. I'll pitch the low note carefully so a wolf looks up for the high one.
dlg resident.job : I catch an ear before competing sounds sweep it away.
dlg resident.news [world.news] : These were the words that carried. #world.news#.
dlg resident.bye : A quiet bit of road for your ears.

graft @bent_echo resident.hub
choice What does a good corner do for your voice? -> bent_echo
node bent_echo
say Gives me my last word back sharply enough to hear whether the price reached the far side. Take three steps and a hard wall may as well be soft earth.
choice Can an echo make you louder? -> bent_echo_more
choice Listen from the near side. -> hub
node bent_echo_more
say It might make me sound like two wolves. I'd sooner sound like one with something worth the effort of hearing. I choose the wall that clears the ending.
choice Listen from the near side. -> hub
choice Slip away between the calls. -> bye
